flowchart LR
    CLI[Backtest CLI] --> M[Scoped Monitor]
    CLI --> R[run_backtest_once]
    R --> S[Engine / generator / repository stage helpers]
    S --> A[Bounded in-memory counters and nested totals]
    M --> A
    A --> C[Initial / safe checkpoint / final publication]
    C --> P[Dedicated timeout-limited pool]
    P --> DB[(PostgreSQL cumulative header + stages)]
    DB --> G[Grafana Backtest Performance]
    C --> F[Slow or failed: disable periodic attempts]
    A --> J[Final local JSON + slowest-stage log]
    R --> O[Opt-in replay cProfile artifact]
